abstract: >-
  A dependency-free JavaScript reference implementation, browser calculator,
  example datasets, and reproducible benchmarks for Log-Age Quadrature ICM, a
  deterministic poker tournament ICM method based on integration over log
  search age.
keywords:
  - poker
  - independent chip model
  - ICM
  - numerical quadrature
  - Gauss-Legendre quadrature
  - tournament equity
